    <string name="lockscreen_service_label">Audio Reading lock-screen controls</string>
    <string name="lockscreen_service_description">Shows Audio Reading\'s controls on the lock screen while a book plays. Only an accessibility service may draw above the lock screen, which is why this is one. It listens only to the system lock screen, and reads one thing there: whether the PIN field is showing, so the controls can make way for it. It reads no other app, and nothing leaves the phone.</string>
